  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting Persecution, Achieving Inclusion, Realizing Environmental Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the programme are to support minority and indigenous activists, including women, to: 

1.	Secure respect for human rights &amp; fundamental freedoms (including freedom of religion or belief) while combatting persecution. 
2.	Challenge discrimination, marginalization and poverty that hinder inclusive sustainable development efforts.
3.	Support their efforts to manage natural resources and mitigate climate change, and participate in decision in support of climate and environmental justice.

The work towards the three above impacts will also address intersectional discrimination based on gender, faith, disability, age or sexual orientation.</narrative>
  </description>
